WEBVTT

00:09:56.464 --> 00:10:00.492
only when my outside
matches my inner being.

00:10:01.752 --> 00:10:04.034
Isn't this all we're looking for?

00:10:06.094 --> 00:10:09.685
We can be anybody; maybe two, maybe three.

00:10:09.685 --> 00:10:11.452
Whoever we are,

00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:17.196
unless or until our inside personality
matches our outside personality,

00:10:17.196 --> 00:10:20.396
our outside personality
matches our inside personality,

00:10:20.396 --> 00:10:23.795
we cannot live in peace,
we cannot live in harmony.

00:10:27.245 --> 00:10:31.180
Now, because math became
my art, became my reminder,